### Feature Delivery — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### UPDATE (PUT)
# @name updateDeliveryPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "orderId": 1,
  "deliveryDriverId": 1,
  "startDate": "2026-10-05T15:00:00Z",
  "endDate": "2026-10-05T15:30:00Z",
  "total": 5000,
  "observations": "Llamar al llegar"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH)
# @name updateDeliveryPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/deliveries/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "observations": "Llamar al llegar"
}
